  "description": "Our PD2 isn't just a PD1 with better componentry; while you will find a more advanced Suntour fork and an upgraded Microshift 9-speed Advent drivetrain, the frame itself features a tapered head tube that uses sealed bearings which results not only in smoother turning, but also in a stiffer, more durable front end.\nHaro PD2 frame made from X6 6000-series alloy featuring internal cable routing and a tapered head tube\nSuntour XCT-30 fork w/1-1/8\" steerer tube and 100mm travel w/ lockout\nAlloy forged crankset w/ steel 32T chainring and plastic guard; 170mm size small, 175mm size medium - XLarge\nMicroshift, ADVENT medium cage w/ clutch\nMicroshift 9-spd Trail Pro shifter\n27.5\" double-wall aluminum rims w/23mm inner diameter\nAlloy quick release, 6-bolt disc compatible hubs\nStainless steel spokes\nKenda Kwick 27.5\"x2.20\" w/ reflective sidewalls\nPromax DSK-320 mechanical brakes w/ 160mm rotors\nExtras: Rear rack, chainstay- mounted kick stand, police branding and alloy bottle cage",
